README.md:4:This is an open, collaborative project with the goal of formalizing stochastic processes and stochastic integration in Lean.
README.md:7:* A formalization of Brownian motion, which is now complete. That task needed a development of the theory of Gaussian distributions, the construction of a projective family of Gaussian distributions and its projective limit by the Kolmogorov extension theorem, and a proof of a Kolmogorov-Chentsov continuity theorem.
README.md:9:* A definition of stochastic integrals and proof of Ito's lemma. This is in progress.
README.md:14:### Brownian motion
README.md:16:We now have a full implementation of a Brownian motion on the positive real half line, and are in the process of migrating our results to Mathlib.
README.md:19:We also have a preprint, available at [https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.20118](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.20118). To cite our work on Brownian motion, please use the following BibTex entry:
