  Clearly, the stopped process $M^{\tau}\mathbb{I}_{\tau > 0}$ is cadlag and it remains to show that it is a martingale.

  Fixing $s \le t \in T$, as $\{\tau > 0\} \in \mathcal{F}_0 \subseteq \mathcal{F}_s$, we have
