+\(\mathcal F_0\subseteq\mathcal F_t\) for every \(t\).  Hence
+\(A-Z\) is strongly progressive.  Under the usual hypotheses, strong
+progressivity gives strong measurability of the running-supremum process
+for \(A-Z\).
